1
00:00:00,881 --> 00:00:05,631
(Steph:)Leonard? Why haven't I heard a thing about
this woman who lives across the hall...

2
00:00:05,803 --> 00:00:10,433
(Steph:)...and comes into your apartment
in the morning in her underwear?

3
00:00:14,812 --> 00:00:16,392
Um. Uh...

4
00:00:16,564 --> 00:00:20,194
(Leonard:)She's heard about you
because we're, you know, involved...

5
00:00:20,359 --> 00:00:24,029
(Leonard:)...and you haven't heard about her
because...

6
00:00:24,864 --> 00:00:26,824
(Leonard:)I never slept with her, I swear.

7
00:00:27,783 --> 00:00:31,073
In Leonard's defense,
it wasn't for lack of trying.

8
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:35,290
- Thank you, Sheldon.
- You're welcome, Leonard.

9
00:00:36,459 --> 00:00:38,709
(Leonard:)Look, I'm just saying, um...

10
00:00:38,878 --> 00:00:42,218
...Penny is one of our many neighbors,
you know.

11
00:00:42,381 --> 00:00:45,051
(Leonard:)And in our building,
neighbors come and go.

12
00:00:45,217 --> 00:00:47,807
Well, it's very casual. No dress code or...

13
00:00:48,387 --> 00:00:51,427
Some mornings, I'll mosey down
to the third floor in my pajamas...

14
00:00:51,599 --> 00:00:54,099
(Leonard:)...and have cereal with Mrs. Vartabedian.

15
00:00:54,268 --> 00:00:58,688
Really? I've never once been invited
to have cereal with Mrs. Vartabedian.

